From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 14:19:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] mfd: mt6397: add the MT6351 AUXADC cell

Expose the MT6351 auxiliary ADC as a cell, as the MT6357, MT6358 and
MT6359 do, so the AUXADC driver can bind to it.
---
 drivers/mfd/mt6397-core.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mfd/mt6397-core.c b/drivers/mfd/mt6397-core.c
index b8e8050ec..278fad50d 100644
--- a/drivers/mfd/mt6397-core.c
+++ b/drivers/mfd/mt6397-core.c
@@ -226,6 +226,9 @@ static const struct mfd_cell mt6331_mt6332_devs[] = {
 
 static const struct mfd_cell mt6351_devs[] = {
 	{
+		.name = "mt6359-auxadc",
+		.of_compatible = "mediatek,mt6351-auxadc",
+	}, {
 		.name = "mt6351-regulator",
 		.of_compatible = "mediatek,mt6351-regulator",
 	}, {
-- 
2.43.0

